\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {6.3}{\ignorespaces Linear solve of the free-dof system of a Quad4 plane-stress plate (clamped at one end, tip load): SciPy (default) against PyTorch, on the CPU and on the GPU, by conjugate gradients (Jacobi preconditioner, relative tolerance $10^{-10}$) and by the dense method (not run above $12\,000$ degrees of freedom). Each time is the minimum of three runs and includes the conversion to tensors and back. The last column is the largest relative difference to the SciPy solution. Records of the author's machine (GTX 1050\xspace  ), not measured for this book.\relax }}{53}{table.caption.101}\protected@file@percent }
